cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "LLM Latency Tracker: measured latency and uptime for AI inference APIs"
abstract: >-
  Independent, continuously measured latency (DNS to TCP to TLS to TTFB) and
  inference time-to-first-token for ~45 AI inference API providers across four
  regions. Probes run every five minutes from separate network locations and are
  never routed through a gateway, so the numbers describe the providers rather
  than a proxy in front of them. Daily snapshots are published in this repository;
  the live dataset, the full methodology and the raw-data retention policy are at
  https://llmlatency.dev.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "llmlatency.dev"
    website: "https://llmlatency.dev"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mazamaka/llm-latency-tracker"
url: "https://llmlatency.dev"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - llm
  - latency
  - benchmark
  - ai-inference
  - observability
  - time-to-first-token
